      -1.5,
      16.5,
      13.5,
      1.5
    ],
    "lattice_conformant": true,
    "corner_rule": "rotating the authored (+Z,+X) corner by 90 degree steps gives (+X,-Z), (-Z,-X), (-X,+Z) - exactly the four corners of a rectangular plan. A wall that simply ENDS needs (+Z,-X), which is a mirror, not a rotation, and is not in this kit."
